"},{"text":"பெய்","lemma":"பெய்","gloss":"filled"}],"gloss":"gold-filled"},{"surface":"பேழை","parts":[{"text":"பேழை","lemma":"பேழை","gloss":"chest"}],"gloss":"chest"},{"surface":"மூய்","parts":[{"text":"மூய்","lemma":"மூய்","gloss":"lid"}],"gloss":"lid"},{"surface":"திறந்து","parts":[{"text":"திறந்து","lemma":"திற","gloss":"having opened"}],"gloss":"having opened"},{"surface":"அன்ன","parts":[{"text":"அன்ன","lemma":"அன்ன","gloss":"like"}],"gloss":"like"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"கார்","parts":[{"text":"கார்","lemma":"கார்","gloss":"rainy season"}],"gloss":"rainy season"},{"surface":"எதிர்","parts":[{"text":"எதிர்","lemma":"எதிர்","gloss":"welcoming"}],"gloss":"welcoming"},{"surface":"புறவினதுவே","parts":[{"text":"புறவு","lemma":"புறவு","gloss":"forest pasture"},{"text":"இன்","lemma":"இன்","gloss":"oblique"},{"text":"அது","lemma":"அது","gloss":"of"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ஏ","gloss":"indeed"}],"gloss":"indeed of the forest pasture"},{"surface":"உயர்ந்தோர்க்கு","parts":[{"text":"உயர்ந்தோர்","lemma":"உயர்ந்தோர்","gloss":"noble people"},{"text":"க்கு","lemma":"கு","gloss":"to"}],"gloss":"to the noble guests"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"நீரொடு","parts":[{"text":"நீர்","lemma":"நீர்","gloss":"water"},{"text":"ஒடு","lemma":"ஒடு","gloss":"with"}],"gloss":"with water"},{"surface":"சொரிந்த","parts":[{"text":"சொரிந்த","lemma":"சொரி","gloss":"poured"}],"gloss":"poured"},{"surface":"மிச்சில்","parts":[{"text":"மிச்சில்","lemma":"மிச்சில்","gloss":"leftover food"}],"gloss":"leftover food"},{"surface":"யாவர்க்கும்","parts":[{"text":"யாவர்க்கும்","lemma":"யாவர்","gloss":"to everyone"}],"gloss":"to everyone"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"வரைகோள்","parts":[{"text":"வரை","lemma":"வரை","gloss":"limit"},{"text":"கோள்","lemma":"கோள்","gloss":"measure"}],"gloss":"limit"},{"surface":"அறியா","parts":[{"text":"அறியா","lemma":"அறி","gloss":"not knowing"}],"gloss":"limitless"},{"surface":"சொன்றி","parts":[{"text":"சொன்றி","lemma":"சொன்றி","gloss":"boiled rice"}],"gloss":"boiled rice"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"நிரைகோல்","parts":[{"text":"நிரை","lemma":"நிரை","gloss":"row"},{"text":"கோல்","lemma":"கோல்","gloss":"beauty/design"}],"gloss":"orderly arranged"},{"surface":"குறுந்தொடி","parts":[{"text":"குறும்","lemma":"குறு","gloss":"small"},{"text":"தொடி","lemma":"தொடி","gloss":"bangle"}],"gloss":"small bangles"},{"surface":"தந்தை","parts":[{"text":"தந்தை","lemma":"தந்தை","gloss":"father"}],"gloss":"father"},{"surface":"ஊரே","parts":[{"text":"ஊர்","lemma":"ஊர்","gloss":"town"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ஏ","gloss":"indeed"}],"gloss":"town indeed"}]}],"literal":"In the gravelly path, the wide-mouthed small pit dug up, / with bright flowers of the Konrai tree scattered, like rich people's / gold-filled chest's lid being opened, / is the forest pasture welcoming the rainy season. There, to the noble guests, / after pouring water, the leftover food, and to everyone, / boiled rice without any limit, is given in / the town of the father of the girl wearing orderly small bangles!","translation":"The small, wide-mouthed pits dug up in the gravelly paths are filled with the scattered bright blossoms of the konrai tree, looking just like a gold-filled chest of the wealthy when its lid is opened. Such is the forest pasture land welcoming the rainy season. In this place lies the town of the father of the girl who wears neat, small bangles—a town where noble guests are served first with water, and limitless rice is offered to everyone else.","modern":"பரல் கற்கள் நிறைந்த பாதையில் தோண்டப்பட்ட அகன்ற வாயையுடைய சிறிய குழிகளில், கொன்றை மரத்தின் பிரகாசமான மலர்கள் உதிர்ந்து பரவிக் கிடக்கின்றன. அது, செல்வந்தர்களின் பொன் நிறைந்த பெட்டியின் மூடியைத் திறந்தது போலத் தோற்றமளிக்கிறது. இத்தகைய கார் காலத்தை வரவேற்கும் முல்லை நிலக் காட்டின் நடுவே இருக்கிறது, வரிசையான சிறிய வளையல்களை அணிந்த தலைவியின் தந்தையினுடைய ஊர். அங்கே, சான்றோர்களுக்கு நீர வார்த்து உபசரித்த பின் எஞ்சிய உணவையும், மற்ற அனைவருக்கும் எல்லையற்ற உணவையும் வழங்கும் வள்ளல் தன்மை நிலவுகிறது.","explanation":"The hero (talaivaṉ) is speaking to his charioteer as they return to the heroine's town during the onset of the rainy season. He describes the beautiful forest pasture (mullai) landscape, where the bright yellow konrai flowers have fallen into small pits on the gravelly path, resembling open chests of gold. This rich visual imagery reflects the prosperity and natural beauty of the heroine's homeland. He praises her father's town for its exceptional hospitality, where noble guests are honored first and limitless food is served to everyone. By highlighting the virtue and generosity of her family, the hero expresses his joy and eagerness to reunite with his beloved, who wears neat, small bangles.","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"},"timing":{"male":[[0.0,0.5],[0.5,0.7],[0.7,1.45],[1.45,1.8],[1.88,2.0],[2.17,2.34],[2.51,3.2],[3.2,3.6],[3.77,4.27],[4.6,5.3],[5.3,5.4],[5.4,5.6],[5.7,6.1],[6.1,6.5],[6.98,7.1],[7.1,7.8],[7.8,8.9],[8.9,9.1],[9.1,9.4],[9.4,9.8],[9.8,10.12],[10.44,11.4],[11.53,11.8],[11.8,12.7],[12.7,13.3],[13.3,13.74],[13.74,14.0]],"female":[[0.0,0.6],[0.6,0.8],[0.8,1.77],[1.77,2.2],[2.2,2.7],[2.7,2.8],[2.8,3.8],[3.8,4.3],[4.3,4.95],[5.44,5.6],[5.6,6.49],[6.49,6.6],[6.6,7.04],[7.04,7.04],[7.04,8.8],[8.8,9.33],[9.33,9.4],[9.4,11.1],[11.1,11.2],[11.2,11.6],[11.6,12.67],[13.19,13.4],[13.46,13.64],[13.7,15.14],[15.14,15.5],[15.5,15.8],[15.93,16.07]]},"sync":[[["கவலை","gravelly path"]],[["கெண்டிய","dug up"]],[["அகல்வாய்","wide-mouthed"],["சிறுகுழி","small pit"]],[["சிறுகுழி","small pit"]],[["கொன்றை","golden shower tree"]],[["ஒள்வீ","bright flowers"]],[["தாஅய்","having spread"],["செல்வர்","rich people's"]],[["செல்வர்","rich people's"]],[["பொன்பெய்","gold-filled"]],[["பேழை","chest"]],[["மூய்","lid"],["திறந்து","having opened"]],[["திறந்து","having opened"],["அன்ன","like"]],[["கார்","rainy season"],["எதிர்","welcoming"]],[["புறவினதுவே","indeed of the forest pasture"]],[["புறவினதுவே","indeed of the forest pasture"]],[["உயர்ந்தோர்க்கு","to the noble guests"]],[["நீரொடு","with water"]],[["சொரிந்த","poured"]],[["மிச்சில்","leftover food"]],[["யாவர்க்கும்","to everyone"]],[["வரைகோள்","limit"]],[["வரைகோள்","limit"],["அறியா","limitless"]],[["சொன்றி","boiled rice"]],[["நிரைகோல்","orderly arranged"]],[["குறுந்தொடி","small bangles"]],[["தந்தை","father"]],[["ஊரே","town indeed"]]]}